  "whatsapp_greeting": "\ud83d\udcb0 Hi! I'm your personal finance assistant. I can help you:\n\n\u2705 Record spending and income\n\ud83d\udccb Manage bills and due dates\n\ud83d\udcca Track monthly budgets\n\ud83c\udfaf Reach your savings goals\n\ud83d\udd14 Send automatic reminders\n\ud83d\udca1 Give insights into your finances\n\n\ud83d\udd14 You'll receive alerts about:\n\u2022 Bills nearing their due date\n\u2022 Budgets at their limit\n\u2022 Goals close to their deadline\n\u2022 Large transactions\n\u2022 Weekly and monthly summaries\n\nHow can I help you today?",
